PUNGGOL (crate `punggol`), part of the OUTRAM PARK workspace. AGPL-3.0-only.

Upstream works this crate ports or will port:

1. OpenMC (https://github.com/openmc-dev/openmc), MIT licence.
   Copyright (c) 2011-2025 Massachusetts Institute of Technology, UChicago
   Argonne LLC, and OpenMC contributors.
   Ported into `src/decay_spectrum.rs` and `src/openmc_photon/`:
   - `openmc/data/decay.py` (`decay_photon_energy`), `openmc/material.py`
     (`Material.get_decay_photon_energy`), `openmc/stats/univariate.py`
     (`DecaySpectrum`, `combine_distributions`, clip routines), and
     `src/distribution.cpp` (`DecaySpectrum`);
   - `src/photon.cpp`, `include/openmc/photon.h`, `src/bremsstrahlung.cpp`,
     `src/physics.cpp`, `src/endf.cpp`, and `include/openmc/search.h`
     (photon interaction samplers, thick-target bremsstrahlung, and reaction
     sampling).
   Commit 8f79d9d02483c90e4134f03a9df4b75ce6b062bf. This is an independent
   translation, not an OpenMC release, and is not endorsed by the OpenMC
   project. The MIT permission notice is carried in
   verification_and_validation/decay_photon_spectra/openmc_inputs/LICENSE.openmc
   and in the `src/openmc_photon/` file headers.

2. EGSnrc (https://github.com/nrc-cnrc/EGSnrc), GNU Affero General Public
   License version 3 (file headers: or, at the licensee's option, a later
   version). Copyright (C) National Research Council Canada and EGSnrc
   contributors.
   Ported into `src/egsnrc/` from commit
   bd49a47aae3938f49f4100b8e018091861408b19 (`HEN_HOUSE/src/*.mortran` and
   `*.macros`, `HEN_HOUSE/pegs4/pegs4.mortran`, and
   `HEN_HOUSE/egs++/estar/*.cpp` for `egs_compoundstoelements`), with
   RANMAR/RANLUX and alias-table/interpolation primitives in `petir`.
   Parts of EGSnrc originate from SLAC (EGS4) and carry their own notice in
   the file headers; each ported file retains its attribution header block
   (upstream project, file, commit, copyright, licence). This is an independent
   Rust translation, not an official EGSnrc release.
